{"q":"79","t":"Word Search","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an <code>m x n</code> grid of characters <code>board</code> and a string <code>word</code>, return <code>true</code> <em>if</em> <code>word</code> <em>exists in the grid</em>.</p>\n\n<p>The word can be constructed from letters of sequentially adjacent cells, where adjacent cells are horizontally or vertically neighboring. The same letter cell may not be used more than once.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/b863d1b2795e2776.jpg\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 242px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;E&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;F&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;S&quot;],[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;D&quot;,&quot;E&quot;,&quot;E&quot;]], word = &quot;ABCCED&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/9e91a0f312f16093.jpg\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 242px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;E&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;F&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;S&quot;],[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;D&quot;,&quot;E&quot;,&quot;E&quot;]], word = &quot;SEE&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/79910d16c5cf6abc.jpg\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 242px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;B&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;E&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;F&quot;,&quot;C&quot;,&quot;S&quot;],[&quot;A&quot;,&quot;D&quot;,&quot;E&quot;,&quot;E&quot;]], word = &quot;ABCB&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>m == board.length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>n = board[i].length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 6</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= word.length &lt;= 15</code></li>\n\t<li><code>board</code> and <code>word</code> consists of only lowercase and uppercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong> Could you use search pruning to make your solution faster with a larger <code>board</code>?</p>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"exist\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"board\",\r\n      \"type\": \"character[][]\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"word\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Backtracking","slug":"backtracking"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Matrix","slug":"matrix"}],"s":[{"t":"Word Search II","s":"word-search-ii","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Uber","uber"],["Meta","facebook"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Faire","faire"],["Grammarly","grammarly"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Atlassian","atlassian"],["Snap","snapchat"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Karat","karat"],["Netflix","netflix"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["Oracle","oracle"],["PayPal","paypal"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Apple","apple"],["Epic Systems","epic-systems"],["Samsung","samsung"],["eBay","ebay"],["Citadel","citadel"],["Visa","visa"],["IBM","ibm"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",7],["Google","google",3],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2],["Grammarly","grammarly",2],["Faire","faire",2]],"b":[["Uber","uber",6],["Microsoft","microsoft",5],["Meta","facebook",3],["TikTok","tiktok",2]],"m":[["Karat","karat",13],["Atlassian","atlassian",11],["PayPal","paypal",8],["Netflix","netflix",5],["Salesforce","salesforce",5],["Apple","apple",4],["Oracle","oracle",4],["Epic Systems","epic-systems",4],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs",3],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",3]]}}